:: Burnout
# 💀 Burned Out

You collapse. Between late nights, stress, and never taking a break, your body finally says *enough*.

You're withdrawn from school mid-year and spend the rest of the semester recovering.

**Your goal of getting into a top university slips away — not from failure, but from forgetting to take care of yourself.**

---

*Sometimes the bravest thing isn't pushing harder. It's knowing when to stop.*

[[Start Over->Start]]

:: Expelled
