# 📅 Late September — The Rumour

School is picking up pace. Then, between classes, you catch pieces of a conversation.

*"Cognito finished my whole history essay in like four minutes."*
*"No way. Did you get caught?"*
*"Nah. It even writes in your style."*

You keep walking. You don't need that. But the name sticks in your head. **Cognito.**

